{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actingTenant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" by default, which is what keeps a client built before contract 1.51 sending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"byte-for-byte the same headers it always did: the header is sent only when this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/actingTenant(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":") has set a value. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UUID"},{"type":"text","text":", never a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— the server parses the header as a UUID and silently ignores a value that does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not parse, so typing this as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UUID"},{"type":"text","text":" is what makes “refuse a non-UUID client-side,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before any wire call” (§5.2 rule 1) a property of the type rather than a runtime"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"check this SDK has to remember to perform."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Meaningful only for an organization-level principal — see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel"},{"type":"text","text":". Set here, before any login exists to gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against, this value is sent as asked and the server’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"403"},{"type":"text","text":" is the answer for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"principal it does not fit (§5.2 rule 1: “gate it on what the SDK knows”). It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"REST-only: this SDK ships no gRPC transport, so §5.2 rule 1 has nothing else to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reach."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamconfig\/actingtenant"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tenant an "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"organization-level"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" principal acts on, sent as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-Axiam-Tenant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(CONTRACT.md §5.2 rule 1, contract 1.51)."}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ConfigV12actingTenant10Foundation4UUIDVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actingTenant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"actingTenant"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamConfig"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamConfig\/actingTenant","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"title":"AxiamClient","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text"